#====================================================================
# DRAFT-hdrhistogram-c-0.11.8-sysroot-lib-inject-test-recovery —
# OHOS 下用 sysroot 系统库注入恢复 find_package 门控的上游测试入口
# 触发事件: hdrhistogram-c 0.11.8 首次适配，log_test(25例) 因 conan
#           工具链找不到 sysroot 内 zlib 而 uninstantiated
# 路径: Path B（知识库扩展）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-hdrhistogram-c-0.11.8-sysroot-lib-inject-test-recovery
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|ctest|conan-verify
phase:                  conan_verify|configure|test_package|upstream_tests
error_signature:        Could NOT find ZLIB (missing: ZLIB_LIBRARY ZLIB_INCLUDE_DIR)|
                         HDR_LOG_REQUIRED=ON and unable to find zlib|
                         test not.*instantiat|uninstantiated|log_test.*not built|
                         tests_run: 0

severity:               2
category:               ohos|conan|cmake|testing|system-library
match_keywords:         sysroot, ZLIB_INCLUDE_DIR, ZLIB_LIBRARY, ZLIB_LIBRARY_RELEASE,
                         find_package(ZLIB), CMakeToolchain, tc.variables,
                         HDR_LOG_ENABLED, HDR_LOG_REQUIRED, os=OHOS, glob,
                         aarch64-linux-ohos, Module mode, upstream test entry,
                         log_test, if(UNIX), CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME, HarmonyOS,
                         configure_executable_total, source_declared_total
title:                  Restore find_package-gated upstream test entries on OHOS by injecting sysroot system library paths (ZLIB) in the recipe generate(); pair with if(UNIX) guard extension and dual-caliber test ledger

topic: >
  HdrHistogram_c 0.11.8 test/CMakeLists.txt registers hdr_histogram_log_test
  (25 mk tests) only when HDR_LOG_ENABLED (=ZLIB_FOUND). The OHOS sysroot
  ships zlib (zlib.h + libz.so) but the conan-generated conan_toolchain.cmake
  only prepends the generators dir to CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH and never searches the
  sysroot, so Module-mode find_package(ZLIB) fails and the log component plus
  its 25 test cases silently stay uninstantiated (log impl degrades to
  hdr_histogram_log_no_op.c). Existing archive recipes (assimp/aevol, 29 in
  total) inject ZLIB paths from a CONAN dependency package_folder (requires
  zlib/...) ; the kpackage draft fixes the consumer-side find_dependency(ZLIB).
  Neither covers "library directly consumes a sysroot SYSTEM library and the
  goal is restoring the gated UPSTREAM TEST ENTRY".

root_cause: >
  1) OHOS cross builds: conan CMakeToolchain does not add the sysroot to
     CMAKE_FIND_ROOT_PATH/search paths, so Module find_package(ZLIB) misses the
     sysroot system lib;
  2) upstream gates BOTH the log implementation (hdr_histogram_log.c vs
     _no_op.c) and the log tests on find_package(ZLIB), so a missed zlib
     silently drops 25 test cases and the real log component;
  3) flipping HDR_LOG_REQUIRED=ON alone is not enough (find_package still
     misses), and upstream SEND_ERRORs when REQUIRED=ON but zlib not found —
     so an injection that may fail must not hard-fail the build.

rec_approach: >
  In conanfile.py generate(): when self.settings.os == "OHOS" and a sysroot is
  found via glob("/data/service/hnp/ohos-sdk.org/*/ohos/native/sysroot"):
  tc.variables["HDR_LOG_REQUIRED"]="ON";
  tc.variables["ZLIB_INCLUDE_DIR"] = sysroot + "/usr/include";
  tc.variables["ZLIB_LIBRARY"] = sysroot + "/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-ohos/libz.so";
  tc.variables["ZLIB_LIBRARY_RELEASE"] = same; else HDR_LOG_REQUIRED="OFF".
  Notes: glob the SDK root instead of hardcoding the version; always also set
  ZLIB_LIBRARY_RELEASE (Module mode reads it in Release); guard by settings.os
  so non-OHOS platforms are unchanged; no extra conan requires, consume the
  system lib directly (zlib is a base OHOS system library).
  Companion fixes for the same class of gated entries: extend upstream
  if(UNIX) guards to also match CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME "OHOS"/"HarmonyOS" via a
  patch (enables e.g. hdr_histogram_atomic_concurrency_test, 1 case), and
  report the dual-caliber ledger (source_declared_total=64,
  configured_executable_total=64, executed_passed_total=64/64=100%,
  uninstantiated=0) with per-entry mapping.

recovery_condition: >
  None (fully resolved in this task). If the OHOS SDK path pattern ever
  changes, update the glob; if zlib disappears from the sysroot, fall back to
  HDR_LOG_REQUIRED=OFF (no-op log component) instead of failing the build.

similar_to:              [E323, E438, DRAFT-kpackage-karchive-619]
caused_by:               conan-toolchain-not-searching-sysroot
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with:          conan-dependency-zlib-injection (assimp/aevol style)
reuse_existing:          E138, E152 (CLOCK_* posix constants), E532 (if(UNIX) guard)
new_draft:               true
path_decision:           path_b_new_draft